items/cex-limit-not-unique-at-an-isolated-point.md:7:deps: [fs-limit-unique-at-every-point-of-the-domain, def-limit-point-r, def-function-limit, lem-function-limit-unique, def-neighbourhood-r, def-interval, lem-of-abs-value, lem-of-add-order, lem-of-sign-rules, cor-of-one-positive, def-ordered-field]
items/cex-limit-not-unique-at-an-isolated-point.md-8-justified_by: []
