items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-55-## Facts & Assumptions
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-56-
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-57-**Given:** The field $\mathbb{R}(t)$ of fractions of $\mathbb{R}[t]$, whose elements are written $p/q$ with $p, q \in \mathbb{R}[t]$ and $q \ne 0$, with $p/q = p'/q'$ exactly when $pq' = p'q$; and the set $P$ above. For a nonzero $p \in \mathbb{R}[t]$, $\operatorname{lc}(p)$ denotes its leading coefficient.
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-58-
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md:59:[L1] $(\mathbb{R}(t), P)$ is an ordered field, and $n \cdot 1 < t$ for every natural $n$, so it is not Archimedean ([[cex-ordered-field-not-archimedean]], [[def-ordered-field]], [[def-archimedean-field]]).
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-60-
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-61-[L2] A nonzero real polynomial has finitely many real roots, and beyond all of them its values have the constant sign of its leading coefficient; $\mathbb{R}[t]$ is an integral domain, so $\operatorname{lc}(pq) = \operatorname{lc}(p)\operatorname{lc}(q)$ and a product of nonzero polynomials is nonzero ([[cex-ordered-field-not-archimedean]], [[thm-reals-ordered-field]], [[def-field]]).
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-62-
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-63-[L3] In $\mathbb{R}$, a nonzero square is positive ([[lem-of-square-positive]]); a product of two nonzero reals is positive exactly when both are positive or both are negative ([[lem-of-sign-rules]]).
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-64-
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md:65:[L4] In an ordered field, $f < g$ means $g - f \in P$; a positive element has a positive inverse ([[lem-of-inverse-positive]], [[def-ordered-field]]).
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-66-
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-67-[L5] The canonical embedding of $\mathbb{Q}$ into an ordered field is an order embedding, so a rational $q > 0$ names a positive element $q \cdot 1$ of $\mathbb{R}(t)$ ([[lem-of-q-embeds]]).
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-68-
items/ex-rational-function-field-order.md-69-## Verification
